# shadcn/ui Styling & Modern Design System

## **Design System Foundation**

### **Color Palette & Theme**
```typescript
// Use semantic color tokens from shadcn/ui
className="
  bg-background text-foreground        // Primary background/text
  bg-card text-card-foreground         // Card backgrounds
  bg-muted text-muted-foreground       // Subtle backgrounds
  text-primary                          // Brand colors
  text-destructive                      // Error states
  text-muted-foreground                 // Secondary text
  border-border                         // Borders
  ring-ring                             // Focus rings
"
```

### **Typography Scale**
```typescript
// Consistent text sizing
className="
  text-xs      // 12px - Small labels, captions
  text-sm      // 14px - Body text, descriptions
  text-base    // 16px - Default body text
  text-lg      // 18px - Large body text
  text-xl      // 20px - Small headings
  text-2xl     // 24px - Medium headings
  text-3xl     // 30px - Large headings
  text-4xl     // 36px - Display headings
"
```

### **Spacing System**
```typescript
// Consistent spacing using Tailwind scale
className="
  p-1 p-2 p-3 p-4 p-6 p-8          // Padding
  m-1 m-2 m-3 m-4 m-6 m-8          // Margins
  gap-1 gap-2 gap-3 gap-4 gap-6     // Flex/Grid gaps
  space-y-2 space-y-4 space-y-6     // Vertical spacing
  space-x-2 space-x-4 space-x-6     // Horizontal spacing
"
```

## **Component Styling Patterns**

### **Card Components**
```typescript
// Modern card styling with subtle shadows
<Card className="
  bg-card text-card-foreground
  border border-border
  rounded-xl                    // Consistent border radius
  shadow-sm                     // Subtle shadow
  p-6                          // Generous padding
  transition-all duration-200  // Smooth transitions
  hover:shadow-md             // Interactive feedback
">
  <CardHeader className="
    pb-4                       // Header bottom padding
    space-y-2                  // Consistent spacing
  ">
    <CardTitle className="
      text-xl font-semibold    // Clear hierarchy
      text-foreground
    ">
      Title
    </CardTitle>
    <CardDescription className="
      text-sm text-muted-foreground  // Secondary information
    ">
      Description
    </CardDescription>
  </CardHeader>
  <CardContent className="space-y-4">
    {/* Content */}
  </CardContent>
</Card>
```

### **Button Styling**
```typescript
// Consistent button variants
<Button 
  variant="default"           // Primary actions
  className="
    h-9 px-4 py-2            // Consistent sizing
    font-medium               // Clear typography
    transition-all duration-200
    focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring
  "
>

<Button 
  variant="outline"           // Secondary actions
  className="
    border border-input
    hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground
  "
>

<Button 
  variant="ghost"             // Subtle actions
  className="hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground"
>

<Button 
  variant="destructive"       // Destructive actions
  className="
    bg-destructive text-destructive-foreground
    hover:bg-destructive/90
  "
>
```

### **Form Components**
```typescript
// Consistent form styling
<FormItem className="space-y-2">
  <FormLabel className="
    text-sm font-medium
    text-foreground
    leading-none
  ">
    Label
  </FormLabel>
  <FormControl>
    <Input className="
      h-9 w-full
      rounded-md border border-input
      bg-background px-3 py-1
      text-sm
      placeholder:text-muted-foreground
      focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring
      disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50
    " />
  </FormControl>
  <FormMessage className="text-sm text-destructive" />
</FormItem>
```

